WARN Act mass-layoff notice CSVs. Organize by 2-letter state code:

  data/raw/warn/CA/ca_warn_2024.csv
  data/raw/warn/NY/ny_warn_2024.csv
  data/raw/warn/TX/tx_warn_2024.csv

When a file sits directly under `warn/` the ingester falls back to
WARN_FEDERAL; a 2-letter subdirectory name is inferred as the state.

Recognized columns (see backend/h1b_engine/ingest/warn.py::COLUMN_ALIASES):
  Company / Employer / Business,
  Notice Date / WARN Date / Received Date,
  Effective Date / Layoff Date / Separation Date,
  Workers Affected / Employees Affected / Number Affected,
  City, State, Zip, Reason / Closing Type, Industry / NAICS,
  Case Number / WARN Number / Notice ID

Run:  python scripts/ingest.py warn
